{
  "format": "wenjian-plugin",
  "schema": 2,
  "manifest": {
    "id": "org.wenjian.example.organize",
    "name": "示例 · 笔记整理工具",
    "author": "问间开发示例",
    "description": "演示读取、编辑、归档、恢复与清除，所有写入都由问间确认并保留恢复副本。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "apiVersion": 2,
    "minAppBuild": 333,
    "kind": "sandbox",
    "platforms": [
      "mac"
    ],
    "permissions": [
      "notebook.read",
      "notebook.write",
      "notebook.archive",
      "notebook.delete"
    ],
    "network": {
      "local": [],
      "remote": []
    },
    "license": "MIT"
  },
  "view": {
    "html": "<h1>笔记整理工具</h1><p>开发接口示例。请先用虚构资料试用；修改会影响真实笔记，并在后续同步传播。</p><button id=\"load\">读取授权记录</button><p><select id=\"records\"><option>先读取记录</option></select></p><textarea id=\"text\" rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"选择记录后，可修改自己的正文\"></textarea><p><input id=\"reason\" placeholder=\"本次修改原因\"></p><button data-action=\"update\">编辑正文</button> <button data-action=\"archive\">归档</button> <button data-action=\"restore\">恢复归档</button> <button data-action=\"purge\">清除记录</button><pre id=\"status\"></pre>",
    "css": "textarea,input,select{width:100%;padding:8px;border:1px solid #ddd1bf;border-radius:8px}button{margin:3px}",
    "js": "let rows=[];const select=document.querySelector('#records'),area=document.querySelector('#text'),status=document.querySelector('#status');const fields={question:'body',cross:'text',card:'text',process:'interpretation',reading:'text'};function choose(){const item=rows[Number(select.value)];area.value=item?item.record[fields[item.kind]]||'':'';}async function load(){const s=await wenjian.notebook.read();rows=[];for(const [kind,column]of Object.entries({question:'notes',cross:'crossThoughts',card:'cards',process:'readingNotes',reading:'bookThoughts',highlight:'libraryHighlights'}))for(const record of s.data[column]||[])rows.push({kind,record});select.replaceChildren(...rows.map((item,i)=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=i;o.textContent=item.kind+' · '+(item.record.title||item.record.text||item.record.quote||item.record.interpretation||item.record.id).slice(0,70);return o;}));choose();status.textContent='已读取 '+rows.length+' 条记录';}select.onchange=choose;document.querySelector('#load').onclick=()=>load().catch(e=>status.textContent=e.message);for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-action]'))b.onclick=async()=>{try{const item=rows[Number(select.value)];if(!item)throw Error('先选择记录');const action=b.dataset.action,op={action,kind:item.kind,id:item.record.id};if(action==='update'){if(!fields[item.kind])throw Error('此记录不提供正文编辑');op.patch={[fields[item.kind]]:area.value};}const p=await wenjian.changes.preview([op],document.querySelector('#reason').value);status.textContent=p.summary.join('\\n');await wenjian.changes.apply(p.token);await load();}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message;}};"
  },
  "readme": "需要用户自行授予读取、编辑、归档和清除权限；恢复已有归档需启动时勾选包含已归档记录。问题、交叉与书籍保留原件，使用归档。归档分支会说明影响范围。没有网络权限。许可 MIT。"
}
